an  security council is great the western  countries themselves are choosing to  move away from pakistan nobody asked  president biden to not call the  pakistani leadership nobody forced  western countries to lean towards india  but government leaders here say it's not  a pivot from old alliances and relations  cannot be mutually exclusive they want  both ties with russia and a diplomatic  solution to the war in ukraine osama bin  laden jazeera islamabad
 

